<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to tender for up to 32,000 tonnes US barley.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender for up to 32,000 tonnes US barley.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Barley Association will tender on Friday for either 26,000 or 32,000 tonnes U.S. barley, local traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The shipment would be slated for delivery from October 20 to November 10.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
